ssuecomment-2624523177","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102185","id":2624523177,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cbwup","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-30T13:30:12Z","updated_at":"2025-01-30T13:38:09Z","body":"Actually I *can* reproduce the issue, I was testing it wrong.\n\nIt happens when pausing with the pause button in the run bar / top right corner, and not with the pause button in the embedded game viewport.\n\nIt happens with both 2D and 3D scenes (or plain Node, that's not the factor), **whenever no node in the scene has a script**. Hence the script related error.\n\nIt's reproducible in 4.4-beta2, 4.3-stable and 4.2-stable (didn't test earlier), so it's not a recently introduced bug.\n\nThe problem is in `RemoteDebugger::debug` which assumed that any paused scene must have an active script language, so it can trigger script debugging logic. This needs to be refactored a bit to gracefully handle pausing when no script exists. I'm not sure whether it means no debugger should be started at all, or if we can still have debuggers/profilers active without the script part.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2624523177/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5801895718","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102185#issuecomment-5801895718","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102185","id":5801895718,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWdHnJg","user":{"login":"JekSun97","id":130399274,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8W8Kg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130399274?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97","html_url":"https://github.com/JekSun97","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-23T19:53:22Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T19:53:22Z","body":"I cannot reproduce this issue in Godot 4.7.2 and Godot 4.8 dev6.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5801895718/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_